%% title: Interest Accrual and Capitalization Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant CRON as Scheduler (cron)
    participant SVC as InterestService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant K as Kafka (outbox)
    participant LED as ledger-service

    note over CRON: Daily accrual — cron 0 0 1 * * ?
    CRON->>SVC: POST /api/v1/interest/accrue/all
    SVC->>DB: load active interest_rate_configs per product
    loop per account
        SVC->>SVC: resolve config (product, balance tier, effectiveFrom/To)
        SVC->>SVC: compute daily_rate = annual_rate / day_count_basis
        SVC->>SVC: accrued_amount = balance * daily_rate
        SVC->>DB: UPSERT interest_accruals (account, accrualDate, product) status=ACCRUING
    end
    SVC-->>CRON: accrual complete

    note over CRON: Monthly capitalization — cron 0 0 2 1 * ?
    CRON->>SVC: POST /api/v1/interest/capitalize/{accountId}
    SVC->>DB: sum ACCRUING accruals for period
    SVC->>SVC: apply withholding tax (§36/§38d ZDP) → gross/tax/net split
    SVC->>DB: INSERT interest_capitalizations (gross, tax, net)
    SVC->>DB: INSERT withholding_tax (RECORDED)
    SVC->>DB: UPDATE interest_accruals status=CAPITALIZED
    SVC->>DB: INSERT interest_outbox (interest.withholding.recorded.v1)
    SVC-->>CRON: capitalization complete

    note over SVC: Outbox dispatcher (every 5s)
    SVC->>K: publish interest.withholding.recorded.v1
    K-->>LED: credit net amount to customer GL account

    note over CRON: Monthly withholding remittance
    CRON->>SVC: POST /api/v1/interest/withholding/remittances?year&month
    SVC->>DB: aggregate RECORDED withholding_tax rows for tax month
    SVC->>DB: INSERT withholding_remittances
    SVC->>DB: UPDATE withholding_tax status=REMITTED
    SVC->>K: publish interest.withholding.remitted.v1
